OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference awards honour
OL,4,Alocal heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer who has spent 65 years
OL,7,Fsupporting young people and a boy who
OL,8,Ffunds support bears for children
OL,9,Faffected by cancer are among those
OL,10,Frecognised for their outstanding
OL,11,Fcontribution to local communities.
OL,13,FThe BBC Radio Newcastle Make a
OL,14,FDifference Awards heard inspiring
OL,15,Fstories from those who went above and
OL,16,Fbeyond to make life better for others.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
