OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference awards honour
OL,4,Alocal heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FWinners were selected by a panel of
OL,7,Flocal judges, including Hairy Biker Si
OL,8,FKing, Look North's Carol Malia,
OL,9,FNewcastle United legend John Anderson
OL,10,Fand Sunderland AFC icon Gary Bennett,
OL,11,Ffrom hundreds of nominations.
OL,13,FThe awards were presented by BBC Radio
OL,14,FNewcastle's Matt Bailey and Anna Foster
OL,15,Fat a ceremony at Newcastle Racecourse
OL,16,Fon Sunday.
